<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to buy May aviation turbine fuel.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy May aviation turbine fuel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued a tender to buy 25,000 tonnes of aviation turbine fuel for May 11-20 delivery, on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to Bombay on the west coast, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on April 24.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
